'' RUN: '@__FUNCTION_NQ__', the address of the enclosing procedure -- __FUNCTION_NQ__ is its name
'' unquoted. It was declared and left untyped on the grounds that fbc refuses it in -lang fb; fbc
'' refuses only a VALUE use, and the address declined (TKO0994; manual defines/functionnq;
'' fbc-examples repro ice06). Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/function-nq-addr.bas -o tests/codegen/functionnqaddr.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/functionnqaddr.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/functionnqaddr.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1-1
